      "y": 380.0,
      "width": 186.6,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "One investment principle:\n\nLong-term investing\n+ Sufficient cash allocation\n+ Mechanical rebalancing\n+ Never overbet\n\n= A math-guaranteed structural edge",
