      "x": 252.4,
      "y": 560.0,
      "width": 255.2,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "\"To realize the magic of compounding in long-term investing,\n the most important thing is to survive in the market.\n To survive, hold cash and never overbet.\n\n This principle does not change in the age of AI.\"",
